!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1	"All samples were snap-frozen and stored in liquid nitrogen within 20 min after resection. A total of 15μg RNA was extracted from each tissue sample using Trizol (Invitrogen) followed by purification using the RNeasy Mini kit (QIAGEN) according to the manufacture’s recommendation. Ratios of A260/A280 >1.9 and 28S/18S rRNA of 2 were used, ensuring that the RNA samples were highly purified and not degraded."	"All samples were snap-frozen and stored in liquid nitrogen within 20 min after resection. A total of 15μg RNA was extracted from each tissue sample using Trizol (Invitrogen) followed by purification using the RNeasy Mini kit (QIAGEN) according to the manufacture’s recommendation. Ratios of A260/A280 >1.9 and 28S/18S rRNA of 2 were used, ensuring that the RNA samples were highly purified and not degraded."	"All samples were snap-frozen and stored in liquid nitrogen within 20 min after resection. A total of 15μg RNA was extracted from each tissue sample using Trizol (Invitrogen) followed by purification using the RNeasy Mini kit (QIAGEN) according to the manufacture’s recommendation. Ratios of A260/A280 >1.9 and 28S/18S rRNA of 2 were used, ensuring that the RNA samples were highly purified and not degraded."	"All samples were snap-frozen and stored in liquid nitrogen within 20 min after resection. A total of 15μg RNA was extracted from each tissue sample using Trizol (Invitrogen) followed by purification using the RNeasy Mini kit (QIAGEN) according to the manufacture’s recommendation. Ratios of A260/A280 >1.9 and 28S/18S rRNA of 2 were used, ensuring that the RNA samples were highly purified and not degraded."	"All samples were snap-frozen and stored in liquid nitrogen within 20 min after resection. A total of 15μg RNA was extracted from each tissue sample using Trizol (Invitrogen) followed by purification using the RNeasy Mini kit (QIAGEN) according to the manufacture’s recommendation. Ratios of A260/A280 >1.9 and 28S/18S rRNA of 2 we